Error [E0127]: operator `+` is not available on `UserId`
  --> tests/ui/distinct_arith_on_id.jet:6:10
    |
  6 |     c :: a + b
    |          ^^^^^
 Why: `UserId` is a distinct type but isn't marked `#Numeric`, so it doesn't inherit arithmetic operators — only `==` is available
 Fix: add `#Numeric` before the declaration if this is a quantity, or use `.raw()` to work on the underlying value
